From 3fddc5792442577ea7cf3db61b06293faaa0c4ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:21:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 855/913] module: power_domain: fix element_table resource leak
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

create_power_domain_element_table() allocates element_table with
fwk_mm_calloc(), then returns NULL without freeing it when
create_core_cluster_pd_element_table() fails, leaking the allocation.

Free element_table before returning NULL on that error path.

Coverity issue: CID 1200419: Resource leak

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 7ddc184354068d07cc8f4db0c51e6f7f0e2399e5 module: power_domain: fix element_table resource leak]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I0ac9f2eef97dce12a8bc7c569de6b458d82ec781
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/592828
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 .../SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/power_domain_utils.c    | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/power_domain_utils.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/power_domain_utils.c
index 541c9a914..e5f31094c 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/power_domain_utils.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/power_domain_utils.c
@@ -143,6 +143,7 @@ const struct fwk_element *create_power_domain_element_table(
         cluster_state_table_size);
 
     if (status != FWK_SUCCESS) {
+        fwk_mm_free(element_table);
         return NULL;
     }
 
-- 
